Name and icon

Sinampay is a fork of Tendedero. As its author requires, this fork uses a
different name and a different icon, and it is not endorsed by the author of
Tendedero. The original terms for the Tendedero name and icon still apply:

  The MIT License above covers the source code. It does not grant any rights
  to the Tendedero name or the Tendedero icon. Modified or redistributed
  versions must use a different name and a different icon, and must not
  suggest that they are Tendedero or are endorsed by its author.

The MIT License above likewise does not grant rights to the Sinampay name or
icon (drawn by scripts/make-icon.swift and the images in the docs folder).
